{"id":"abc71a8645f60a1c","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Quasi Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy — ZFC Game2 Quasi Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy — ZFC Game2 Quasi Strategy","depends_on":["[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy — ZFC Game2 Quasi Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,T,X,i\\in V\">\\(Q,T,X,i\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(X\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in2\">\\(i\\in2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}with\\text{-}moves}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad X\\neq\\varnothing\\land i\\in2\n\\land T\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\\varnothing\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall s\\in Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2=i\n\\land\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{76pt}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2\\neq i\\to\n\\forall a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T\n\\to s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}with\\text{-}moves}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad X\\neq\\varnothing\\land i\\in2\n\\land T\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\\varnothing\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall s\\in Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2=i\n\\land\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{76pt}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2\\neq i\\to\n\\forall a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T\n\\to s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S(Q,T,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S(Q,T,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The move set and parity convention are explicit. Terminal nodes are allowed; at a nonterminal selected-player node at least one legal move is retained, while every legal opponent move is retained.</li>\n<li>The two turn clauses are separately parenthesized.  Without that grouping the implication at a selected-player node swallowed the opponent clause, making every opponent node vacuously acceptable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)$ (see [[58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,T,X,i\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}with\\text{-}moves}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad X\\neq\\varnothing\\land i\\in2\n\\land T\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\\\\\n&\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\\varnothing\\in Q\\\\\n&\\quad \\land\\forall t\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in Q)\\\\\n&\\quad \\land\\forall s\\in Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2=i\n\\land\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{76pt}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2\\neq i\\to\n\\forall a\\in X\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T\n\\to s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategy}_S(Q,T,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGame2QuasiStrategyWithMoves}_S(Q,T,X,i)","display":true}],"bytes":2242,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy.md|58-df-zfc-game2-quasi-strategy]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["f4bf86f66c1444da","36d7463d215be751"]}